<section class="alt" id="how">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2>Three steps, then it disappears.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="card">
        <h3>Install and open the tray</h3>
        <p>BrightSync finds your displays, names them from their own metadata, and shows each one in Settings.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3>Calibrate each monitor once</h3>
        <p>Set a minimum, a maximum and a multiplier so a dim old panel and a bright new one match at every level.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3>Use one slider or let it run</h3>
        <p>Drag the master slider, bind the CLI to your hotkeys, or switch on the automatic day curve and idle dimming.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
